      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "BIP34 is ambiguous regarding blocks 1-16: it specifies both \"minimally encoded CScript\" and \"first byte is number of bytes in the number\" which differ for those blocks. Bitcoin Core requires minimally encoded CScript, and the existing signet and testnet4 chains have blocks complying with that interpretation. Update the BIP to clarify this.",
